        "id": "norma_holowell-basic_attack-hat_trick",
        "name": "Hat Trick (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "When Norma is the active character and is in combat, she gains 1.5% /bPreheated Chamber//b per second.\n\nWhen /bTop Hat Companion//b is on her head, hold [BASIC] to activate: After firing, Norma throws out /bTop Hat Companion//b, ordering it to unleash a round of aerial fire, dealing Fire DMG and storing the current /bPreheated Chamber//b. When the skill hits an enemy, it triggers the previous character's /bQuick Assist//b. This effect can trigger once every 5s.\n\nOnce /bTop Hat Companion//b has been thrown out, it will accumulate and retain /bPreheated Chamber//b at the same speed on behalf of Norma. Norma does not need to stay on the field during this period. After Norma retrieves the /bTop Hat Companion//b, she immediately gains the stored /bPreheated Chamber//b.\n\nWhen holding [BASIC], the /bTop Hat Companion//b will accelerate toward Norma. If retrieving the /bTop Hat Companion//b would raise /bPreheated Chamber//b to 80% or higher, the /bTop Hat Companion//b will automatically accelerate toward Norma. When Norma switches from on field to off field while in combat, if /bPreheated Chamber//b is not full, /bTop Hat Companion//b automatically enters the battlefield. Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.",
